%I A107639 #15 Aug 14 2026 01:10:53
%S A107639 5,7,31,11,5,3,809,661,139,73,521,701,131,487,89,211,733,3011,311,
%T A107639 8837,2837,8831,1733,401,983,17881,1783,19553,13859,70487,168863
%N A107639 a(n) is the smallest odd prime such that (a(n)*b(n))^2 + a(n)*b(n) - 1 is prime, where b(n) = 2^(2*A098845(n)) - 2^A098845(n) - 1 is prime.
%e A107639 2^4-2^2-1=11=b(1) prime, (5*11)^2+5*11-1=3079 prime so a(1)=5.
%e A107639 2^8-2^4-1=239=b(2) prime, (7*239)^2+7*239-1=2800601 prime so a(2)=7.
%Y A107639 Cf. A098845.
